rking and it's had you know  an impact  on on his personal life as well not just  his  his business and none of his businesses  are taking off  and he's constantly struggling it's  because he hasn't poured himself into  any of them right  he's just trying to look for a way to  get rich quick it doesn't happen that  way  okay he might eke out a living  okay he can earn a little bit of a  living and you can start paying off some  of that debt  but he's not going to be massively  successful you cannot  be massively successful doing things  that you don't love  it's that simple running five businesses  just trying to make a quick buck putting  everybody in your life  you know at risk and and not having  great relationships that's not the path  to success and i get that it all comes  from this desire  it's so hard it can be so hard to see  the path  when you're struggling you have  crippling debt  you have so many people pressuring you  to get money  that that's all you focus on and as  society  we're kind of trained to do that right  we're trained to go  to go make money and to get a bigger  house and to take on debt  where do we learn about following our  passion  and really building great things but  that's the path  that has to be the path and if you're in  that situation where you've got a ton of  debt  you have to find something that is  unique to you  something that you love doing something  that will help other people and start  doing that even if it's on the side part  time  you have to start doing that you have to  find  that unique thing that can really make a  difference in people's lives that can  really really benefit them and something  that you can pour  everything you've got into because it's  not going to come  by finding cheap products and selling  them for a profit on ebay  that's not your path that's not the path  it has to be something that you love  believe for those of you watching like  the video thumbs up below  leave a comment let me know what 